' PAGE -> ADAPTER RELATIONSHIPS
' -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

CustomerManagementPage ..> customerApi : uses
ProductCategoryManagementPage ..> productCategoryApi : uses
AllergenManagementPage ..> allergenApi : uses
ProductManagementPage ..> productApi : uses
PizzaSizeManagementPage ..> pizzaSizeApi : uses
PizzaComponentTypeManagementPage ..> pizzaComponentTypeApi : uses
ComponentSizeConfigurationManagementPage ..> componentSizeConfigurationApi : uses
StockManagementPage ..> stockApi : uses
PredefinedPizzaManagementPage ..> predefinedPizzaApi : uses
CatalogueViewerPage ..> catalogueApi : uses

' -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
' PAGE -> DATA CONTRACT RELATIONSHIPS
' -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

CustomerManagementPage ..> CustomerDTO
CustomerManagementPage ..> CustomerSearchFilters

ProductCategoryManagementPage ..> ProductCategoryDTO
AllergenManagementPage ..> AllergenDTO

ProductManagementPage ..> ProductDTO
ProductManagementPage ..> ProductSearchFilters

PizzaSizeManagementPage ..> PizzaSizeDTO
PizzaComponentTypeManagementPage ..> PizzaComponentTypeDTO

ComponentSizeConfigurationManagementPage ..> ComponentSizeConfigurationDTO
ComponentSizeConfigurationManagementPage ..> ConfigProductReferenceDTO
ComponentSizeConfigurationManagementPage ..> ConfigSizeReferenceDTO

StockManagementPage ..> StockInformationDTO
StockManagementPage ..> StockSearchFilters

PredefinedPizzaManagementPage ..> PredefinedPizzaDTO
CatalogueViewerPage ..> CatalogueDTO
CatalogueViewerPage ..> CatalogueSearchFilters

' -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
' ADAPTER -> SHARED REST CONTRACT
' -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

customerApi ..> ModuleRequest : uses injected request
productCategoryApi ..> ModuleRequest
allergenApi ..> ModuleRequest
productApi ..> ModuleRequest
pizzaSizeApi ..> ModuleRequest
pizzaComponentTypeApi ..> ModuleRequest
componentSizeConfigurationApi ..> ModuleRequest
stockApi ..> ModuleRequest
predefinedPizzaApi ..> ModuleRequest
catalogueApi ..> ModuleRequest

ModuleRequest ..> ApiError : rejects with

' -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
' DTO COMPOSITION AND REFERENCES
' -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

CustomerDTO *-- "0..*" AddressDTO
CustomerDTO *-- "0..*" DietaryRestrictionDTO

ProductDTO *-- "0..1" MoneyDTO : base price
ProductDTO *-- "0..*" ProductCompositionItemDTO : composition
ProductDTO *-- "0..*" ProductAllergenInfo : allergen information
ProductCompositionItemDTO --> ProductDTO : child product reference

ComponentSizeConfigurationDTO *-- "1" MoneyDTO : price

PredefinedPizzaDTO *-- "0..*" ProductCompositionItemDTO : composition
PredefinedPizzaDTO *-- "0..*" PredefinedPizzaSizeAvailabilityDTO
PredefinedPizzaDTO *-- "0..*" ProductAllergenInfo

PredefinedPizzaSizeAvailabilityDTO o-- "0..1" MoneyDTO : price

CatalogueDTO *-- "0..*" ProductAllergenInfo
CatalogueDTO o-- "0..1" CataloguePizzaDetailsDTO : pizza details
CataloguePizzaDetailsDTO *-- "0..*" PredefinedPizzaSizeAvailabilityDTO

