ProductCategoryManagementPage ..> RequireRole : controls action visibility
AllergenManagementPage ..> RequireRole : controls action visibility
ProductManagementPage ..> RequireRole : controls action visibility
PizzaSizeManagementPage ..> RequireRole : controls action visibility
PizzaComponentTypeManagementPage ..> RequireRole : controls action visibility
ComponentSizeConfigurationManagementPage ..> RequireRole : controls action visibility
StockManagementPage ..> RequireRole : controls action visibility
PredefinedPizzaManagementPage ..> RequireRole : controls action visibility

CustomerManagementPage ..> FeedbackMessage
ProductCategoryManagementPage ..> FeedbackMessage
AllergenManagementPage ..> FeedbackMessage
ProductManagementPage ..> FeedbackMessage
PizzaSizeManagementPage ..> FeedbackMessage
PizzaComponentTypeManagementPage ..> FeedbackMessage
ComponentSizeConfigurationManagementPage ..> FeedbackMessage
StockManagementPage ..> FeedbackMessage
PredefinedPizzaManagementPage ..> FeedbackMessage
CatalogueViewerPage ..> FeedbackMessage

CustomerManagementPage ..> LoadingIndicator
ProductManagementPage ..> LoadingIndicator
StockManagementPage ..> LoadingIndicator
CatalogueViewerPage ..> LoadingIndicator

CustomerManagementPage ..> ConfirmDialog
ProductCategoryManagementPage ..> ConfirmDialog
ProductManagementPage ..> ConfirmDialog
StockManagementPage ..> ConfirmDialog
PredefinedPizzaManagementPage ..> ConfirmDialog

CustomerManagementPage ..> LocaleProvider
